   "parent_block_id": null,
   "author_id": "user-gwp-saoirse",
   "text": "Logged for the office: Desmond Quilliam (council filming officer) rang me on 18 November. Agreed by phone: from Tuesday 24 November the Pennick Street suspension drops to 8 residents' bays. Bays 9 to 12 at the top of the street stay open for the dialysis patient transport. Monday 23 November stays at all 12 bays. He is not reissuing the grant letter; this comment is the record.",
   "created_time": "2026-11-18T15:47:00.000Z",
   "resolved": false
  },
  {
   "id": "comment-gwp-0002",
   "parent_page_id": "page-gwp-loc-tannery",
   "parent_block_id": null,
   "author_id": "user-gwp-saoirse",
   "text": "Residents at numbers 2 and 4 asked for the generator to face away from their windows.",
